    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruby's Land - The Park Where Everything Changed</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a place of joy and laughter, Ruby's Land is now a shadow of its past. A mysterious fire reduced the park to ashes, and with it, the director vanished without a trace. Today, no one knows what really happened\u2026 and those who venture too close never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a journalist, you are determined to uncover the truth behind this tragic event. Why has this park been left abandoned? What secrets does it still hide? And most importantly\u2026 what happened to the missing children?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey into the Unknown:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore strange places</strong>: Traverse areas where every detail seems to tell a story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piece together the truth</strong>: Gather scattered clues, solve puzzles, and lift the veil on a forgotten mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A heavy silence of threats</strong>: In Ruby's Land, what\u2019s hidden can be more terrifying than what\u2019s visible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are here for answers. But in Ruby's Land, some questions may be better left unanswered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This park didn\u2019t just burn down\u2026 it changed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruby's Land - The Park Where Everything Changed</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a place of joy and laughter, Ruby's Land is now a shadow of its past. A mysterious fire reduced the park to ashes, and with it, the director vanished without a trace. Today, no one knows what really happened\u2026 and those who venture too close never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a journalist, you are determined to uncover the truth behind this tragic event. Why has this park been left abandoned? What secrets does it still hide? And most importantly\u2026 what happened to the missing children?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey into the Unknown:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore strange places</strong>: Traverse areas where every detail seems to tell a story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piece together the truth</strong>: Gather scattered clues, solve puzzles, and lift the veil on a forgotten mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A heavy silence of threats</strong>: In Ruby's Land, what\u2019s hidden can be more terrifying than what\u2019s visible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are here for answers. But in Ruby's Land, some questions may be better left unanswered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This park didn\u2019t just burn down\u2026 it changed.</p>",
